37
00:01:31,900 --> 00:01:35,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's been a while
since I've eaten Ichiraku ramen!</font>

38
00:01:35,240 --> 00:01:37,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lately I've been away
from home on missions.</font>

39
00:01:38,780 --> 00:01:40,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The bowl of ramen after a mission,</font>

40
00:01:40,990 --> 00:01:45,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it spreads to every muscle of the body
and becomes energy for tomorrow.</font>

41
00:01:45,120 --> 00:01:47,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you eat ramen,
it drives fatigue away.</font>

42
00:01:48,420 --> 00:01:49,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ramen!</font>

43
00:01:50,670 --> 00:01:51,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ramen!</font>

44
00:01:52,880 --> 00:01:53,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ramen!</font>

45
00:01:54,710 --> 00:01:55,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ramen!</font>

46
00:01:57,030 --> 00:01:59,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}"TEMPORARILY CLOSED"</b></font>

47
00:02:02,430 --> 00:02:04,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"Temporarily closed"?</font>

48
00:02:04,640 --> 00:02:06,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, it can't be.</font>

49
00:02:07,980 --> 00:02:14,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I endured all the tough missions,
looking forward to Ichiraku ramen.</font>

50
00:02:14,610 --> 00:02:17,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— I can smell ramen!
— What?</font>

51
00:02:20,700 --> 00:02:21,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're right!</font>

52
00:02:21,870 --> 00:02:25,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Without a doubt,
ramen is being made in there!</font>

53
00:02:27,080 --> 00:02:28,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ramen!</font>

54
00:02:28,740 --> 00:02:33,960
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Burn, Cauldron!</font>

55
00:02:28,740 --> 00:02:33,960
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Mix, Stretch and Boil!!</font>

56
00:02:39,970 --> 00:02:41,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This smell...</font>

57
00:02:41,550 --> 00:02:42,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the smell of a soup</font>

58
00:02:42,930 --> 00:02:45,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that's never been
on the Ichiraku menu before.</font>

59
00:02:45,520 --> 00:02:50,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then... it's temporarily closed
to develop a new menu?</font>

60
00:02:52,940 --> 00:02:54,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who's there?!</font>

61
00:02:59,070 --> 00:03:02,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A large helping of miso char siu ramen!
With an egg please.</font>

62
00:03:07,540 --> 00:03:08,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

63
00:03:08,710 --> 00:03:11,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You were looking forward
to my ramen that much.</font>

64
00:03:11,120 --> 00:03:13,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry about that.</font>

65
00:03:13,540 --> 00:03:15,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's okay to develop a new menu,</font>

66
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:18,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but I wish you'd do it
after the shop is closed.</font>

67
00:03:23,760 --> 00:03:26,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since you came all this way.
Give this a taste.</font>

68
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:29,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could this be...?</font>

69
00:03:29,600 --> 00:03:31,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ichiraku's new menu?!</font>

70
00:03:32,650 --> 00:03:34,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's eat!</font>

71
00:03:34,110 --> 00:03:35,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait a minute!</font>

72
00:03:36,440 --> 00:03:38,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are rules when you're eating
a new ramen for the first time.</font>

73
00:03:38,820 --> 00:03:39,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rule 1!</font>

74
00:03:40,450 --> 00:03:41,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Before you do anything,</font>

75
00:03:41,700 --> 00:03:43,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you must first have
a sip to taste the soup.</font>

76
00:03:47,540 --> 00:03:49,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Delicious!
— Delicious!</font>

77
00:03:49,250 --> 00:03:52,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next, you have to coat the noodles
in soup and eat.</font>

78
00:03:55,380 --> 00:03:59,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? It seems like something
is missing...</font>

79
00:03:59,460 --> 00:04:00,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's get to the point.</font>

80
00:04:01,970 --> 00:04:03,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The noodles are outdone
by the soup!</font>

81
00:04:05,010 --> 00:04:07,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This well-seasoned, rich soup
greatly surpasses</font>

82
00:04:07,430 --> 00:04:10,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">any of Ichiraku's previous soups!</font>

83
00:04:11,060 --> 00:04:14,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But the noodles are
the same as always!</font>

84
00:04:14,150 --> 00:04:16,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The balance is very bad.</font>

85
00:04:17,060 --> 00:04:18,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I cannot give it a passing score!</font>

86
00:04:19,900 --> 00:04:21,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what I thought.</font>

87
00:04:22,610 --> 00:04:25,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't get so depressed.</font>

88
00:04:26,030 --> 00:04:28,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ayame, water! Water, please!</font>

89
00:04:29,290 --> 00:04:31,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Where's Ayame?</font>

90
00:04:31,750 --> 00:04:33,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With ramen like this...</font>

91
00:04:33,920 --> 00:04:38,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll never be able to get Ayame
back from the Ryonin.</font>

92
00:04:41,840 --> 00:04:42,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Old Man!</font>

93
00:04:47,720 --> 00:04:49,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's just overtired.</font>

94
00:04:49,810 --> 00:04:53,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I had him drink an energy drink,
so after a little rest, he'll recover.</font>

95
00:04:53,850 --> 00:04:56,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I think he should take a break
from the shop for a while.</font>

96
00:05:00,150 --> 00:05:02,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's been using his arms too much.</font>

97
00:05:02,650 --> 00:05:04,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look how swollen this is.</font>

98
00:05:04,650 --> 00:05:07,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come to think of it,
before he fell,</font>

99
00:05:07,160 --> 00:05:09,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he said something about Ryonin
or whatever</font>

100
00:05:09,410 --> 00:05:11,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">did something to Ayame, I think.</font>

101
00:05:12,540 --> 00:05:14,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ayame is his daughter, right?</font>

102
00:05:15,830 --> 00:05:18,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What's Ryonin?
— I don't know.</font>

103
00:05:18,330 --> 00:05:22,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ryonin,
he's referring to the Ninja Chef.</font>

104
00:05:22,090 --> 00:05:24,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Ninja Chef?</font>

105
00:05:24,970 --> 00:05:26,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you know about them, Choji?</font>

106
00:05:27,510 --> 00:05:30,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've heard rumors about them.</font>

107
00:05:32,010 --> 00:05:37,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One of the problems Shinobi's confront
on missions is the problem of meals!</font>

108
00:05:38,020 --> 00:05:40,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Normally Food Pills were brought
with them,</font>

109
00:05:40,360 --> 00:05:42,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but the main role of those are
to supply nutrients.</font>

110
00:05:42,150 --> 00:05:43,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They have no taste.</font>

111
00:05:43,990 --> 00:05:46,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If they could eat delicious food
while on missions,</font>

112
00:05:46,950 --> 00:05:50,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">would the success rate of missions rise?</font>

113
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:52,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Based on that theory, was born...</font>

114
00:05:55,410 --> 00:05:58,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Ninja Chef... Ryonin!</font>

115
00:06:01,170 --> 00:06:05,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But what do those Ninja Chef have
to do with Ayame?</font>

116
00:06:05,840 --> 00:06:07,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They snatched her away...</font>

117
00:06:08,340 --> 00:06:09,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

118
00:06:09,430 --> 00:06:11,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you talking about?!</font>

119
00:06:11,760 --> 00:06:13,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give us the details!</font>

120
00:06:13,970 --> 00:06:16,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was two weeks ago...</font>

121
00:06:21,150 --> 00:06:23,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}{"ICHIRAKU RAMEN"</b></font>

122
00:06:23,610 --> 00:06:25,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Welcome!</font>

123
00:06:25,110 --> 00:06:26,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The large serving,
here's your order!</font>

124
00:06:30,200 --> 00:06:33,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A good job as always, Teuchi!</font>

125
00:06:34,540 --> 00:06:35,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hakkaku!</font>

126
00:06:36,080 --> 00:06:37,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His name is Hakkaku,</font>

127
00:06:37,960 --> 00:06:41,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">long ago we trained
at the same ramen shop...</font>

128
00:06:41,250 --> 00:06:43,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}{"CLOSED FOR BREAK"</b></font>

129
00:06:41,600 --> 00:06:45,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He told me he is a Ninja Chef,
a Ryonin, these days.</font>

130
00:06:46,550 --> 00:06:49,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Actually, I have a favor to ask you.</font>

131
00:06:49,510 --> 00:06:53,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it? If it's something I can do,
I'll cooperate.</font>

132
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:57,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The phantom recipe
that I heard you developed...</font>

133
00:06:57,520 --> 00:06:58,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please turn it over to me!</font>

134
00:07:00,440 --> 00:07:03,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Phantom recipe?
What are you talking about?</font>

135
00:07:03,610 --> 00:07:07,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To a chef, a recipe is
more precious than life!</font>

136
00:07:07,190 --> 00:07:09,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand why you want to hide it!</font>

137
00:07:09,360 --> 00:07:12,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... please! Give it to me!</font>

138
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:15,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I really had no clue.</font>

139
00:07:16,450 --> 00:07:20,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Hakkaku didn't believe me.</font>

140
00:07:22,080 --> 00:07:24,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ayame. Let's get to work
opening the shop.</font>

141
00:07:26,170 --> 00:07:27,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the...? What's this tray?</font>

142
00:07:31,840 --> 00:07:32,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ayame!</font>

143
00:07:33,390 --> 00:07:35,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have your daughter.</font>

144
00:07:35,300 --> 00:07:38,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you want her back,
hand over the phantom recipe!</font>

145
00:07:40,060 --> 00:07:42,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn that Hakkaku!</font>

146
00:07:43,480 --> 00:07:46,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why didn't you contact
the Hokage right away?</font>

147
00:07:47,020 --> 00:07:48,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Hokage could...</font>

148
00:07:48,110 --> 00:07:51,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I did that, I don't know
what would happen to Ayame.</font>

149
00:07:52,660 --> 00:07:56,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And he also wrote this
in the letter...</font>

150
00:07:56,700 --> 00:07:59,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That if I can serve them
something impressive,</font>

151
00:07:59,910 --> 00:08:03,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he'll give up on the phantom recipe
and return my daughter safe.</font>

152
00:08:04,580 --> 00:08:06,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you've got a way to win?</font>

153
00:08:07,710 --> 00:08:08,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know.</font>

154
00:08:09,010 --> 00:08:11,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But a chef's challenged me
to a cooking match.</font>

155
00:08:12,090 --> 00:08:13,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have no choice but to do it.</font>

156
00:08:14,010 --> 00:08:17,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, that's why you're developing
new ramen.</font>

157
00:08:18,100 --> 00:08:20,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was able to make the soup
exactly how I wanted to.</font>

158
00:08:21,350 --> 00:08:26,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I just can't get the firm noodles
that go with the soup.</font>

159
00:08:27,190 --> 00:08:30,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't get Ayame back like this!</font>

160
00:08:31,320 --> 00:08:35,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The cooking match is tomorrow.
What am I going to do?</font>

161
00:08:41,580 --> 00:08:45,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't imagine an Ichiraku
without Ayame.</font>

162
00:08:47,880 --> 00:08:51,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! Teuchi! We'll help you.</font>

163
00:08:51,300 --> 00:08:53,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll make the best ramen...</font>

164
00:08:53,510 --> 00:08:55,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And get Ayame back...</font>

165
00:08:55,630 --> 00:08:56,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From the Ryonin!</font>

166
00:09:01,810 --> 00:09:02,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys...</font>

167
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:08,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll teach you the basics
of making noodles.</font>

168
00:09:10,940 --> 00:09:13,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Quickly mix the ingredients evenly.</font>

169
00:09:13,650 --> 00:09:14,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If there are discrepancies,</font>

170
00:09:14,780 --> 00:09:16,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there will be variations
in the taste of the noodles.</font>

171
00:09:16,570 --> 00:09:18,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next, knead it.</font>

172
00:09:18,370 --> 00:09:21,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't do this properly,
the noodles won't be firm.</font>

173
00:09:22,200 --> 00:09:23,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you okay?</font>

174
00:09:23,830 --> 00:09:26,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's nothing. Don't worry about me.</font>

175
00:09:29,380 --> 00:09:31,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And stretch the noodles!</font>

176
00:09:35,260 --> 00:09:38,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's important for them to be
of a uniform thickness!</font>

177
00:09:38,260 --> 00:09:40,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So there will be no differences
after boiling...</font>

178
00:09:45,020 --> 00:09:46,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Try it.</font>

179
00:09:49,230 --> 00:09:51,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's easy to say it,</font>

180
00:09:51,320 --> 00:09:54,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but to actually make the noodles
is not so easy.</font>

181
00:09:55,150 --> 00:09:58,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It takes five years to become
an accomplished chef in his own right.</font>

182
00:09:58,910 --> 00:10:01,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To do it by the match tomorrow
is completely...</font>

183
00:10:02,120 --> 00:10:03,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When it comes down to it,</font>

184
00:10:03,240 --> 00:10:06,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll have to give up this decrepit body
of mine to them.</font>

185
00:10:08,420 --> 00:10:09,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Teuchi...</font>

186
00:10:09,790 --> 00:10:13,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you're not thinking about
when you lose, are you?</font>

187
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:15,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's...</font>

188
00:10:15,670 --> 00:10:17,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because if we are doing this,</font>

189
00:10:17,930 --> 00:10:20,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we're doing it with the intention
of winning!</font>

190
00:10:20,470 --> 00:10:24,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I absolutely don't forgive people
who hold a girl captive!</font>

191
00:10:24,640 --> 00:10:26,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Cooking comes from the heart.</font>

192
00:10:26,520 --> 00:10:29,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Technique and experience
aren't everything!</font>

193
00:10:30,560 --> 00:10:31,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No problem.</font>

194
00:10:32,020 --> 00:10:36,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll show them the real strength
of the Shinobi of Leaf Village!</font>

195
00:10:44,620 --> 00:10:46,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry to make you wait, Hakkaku!</font>

196
00:10:50,460 --> 00:10:52,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The phantom recipe?</font>

197
00:10:53,090 --> 00:10:55,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't tell by looking at me?</font>

198
00:10:56,130 --> 00:10:58,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see. How foolish...</font>

199
00:10:59,340 --> 00:11:00,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let me tell you,</font>

200
00:11:00,720 --> 00:11:03,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">ramen like the stuff I ate
at your shop the other day can't win.</font>

201
00:11:04,350 --> 00:11:05,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is Ayame okay?</font>

202
00:11:06,100 --> 00:11:07,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Father!</font>

203
00:11:08,180 --> 00:11:09,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ayame!</font>

204
00:11:11,190 --> 00:11:13,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The emotional reunion comes
after the match.</font>

205
00:11:14,440 --> 00:11:17,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have a favor to ask.
Let me have some helpers.</font>

206
00:11:17,900 --> 00:11:22,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't think those kids are up
to the task, but...</font>

207
00:11:22,620 --> 00:11:24,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, that's okay.</font>

208
00:11:24,740 --> 00:11:26,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, let's start the cooking match!</font>

209
00:11:32,330 --> 00:11:36,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's see if you can satisfy
all of us Ninja Chef!</font>

210
00:11:37,050 --> 00:11:38,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are so many of them!</font>

211
00:11:39,880 --> 00:11:42,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We don't have time to stand around.
Let's begin!</font>

212
00:11:44,390 --> 00:11:45,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The preparation for the soup is done!</font>

213
00:11:46,060 --> 00:11:47,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll prepare the ingredients
for the rest!</font>

214
00:11:47,810 --> 00:11:49,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm leaving the noodles to you!</font>

215
00:11:49,520 --> 00:11:50,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Okay!
— Okay!</font>

216
00:11:50,640 --> 00:11:55,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen. Our noodles determine
whether Ayame will return or not!</font>

217
00:11:56,190 --> 00:11:57,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We cannot fail!</font>

218
00:11:58,530 --> 00:12:01,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seems like he's done a good job
with the soup...</font>

219
00:12:01,530 --> 00:12:03,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The delicious aroma is wafting
over here.</font>

220
00:12:03,950 --> 00:12:06,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Indeed, it's whetting my appetite.</font>

221
00:12:06,280 --> 00:12:07,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The noodles are the problem!</font>

222
00:12:08,040 --> 00:12:12,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can those kids really make noodles
that will go with that soup?</font>

223
00:12:12,160 --> 00:12:14,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First, mix the ingredients!</font>

224
00:12:15,290 --> 00:12:17,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're amateurs, I thought so!</font>

225
00:12:17,630 --> 00:12:20,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't make decent noodles
with that hand movement!</font>

226
00:12:21,340 --> 00:12:23,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We practiced making noodles all night!</font>

227
00:12:23,880 --> 00:12:27,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But we didn't make the noodles
we wanted to by morning.</font>

228
00:12:27,470 --> 00:12:31,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even so, we have
to make perfect noodles!</font>

229
00:12:35,400 --> 00:12:38,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, hey. At least make us
something edible!</font>

230
00:12:41,280 --> 00:12:42,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Quickly...</font>

231
00:12:42,530 --> 00:12:43,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uniformly...</font>

232
00:12:43,650 --> 00:12:44,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Without discrepancies!</font>

233
00:12:45,660 --> 00:12:47,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next, knead it!</font>

234
00:12:47,700 --> 00:12:49,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Sakura!</font>

235
00:12:49,620 --> 00:12:51,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look, it's Kakashi-sensei.</font>

236
00:12:51,950 --> 00:12:53,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't play!</font>

237
00:12:56,630 --> 00:12:57,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura...</font>

238
00:13:02,420 --> 00:13:06,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ow! Sakura, you just can't control
your own crazy strength!</font>

239
00:13:07,010 --> 00:13:10,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's your fault for playing around
at a time like this!</font>

240
00:13:14,810 --> 00:13:15,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is...</font>

241
00:13:18,810 --> 00:13:21,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is...
the last of the ingredients.</font>

242
00:13:21,480 --> 00:13:24,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No problem. This time,
let us show you we'll succeed!</font>

243
00:13:26,910 --> 00:13:28,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, I'm mixing.</font>

244
00:13:28,950 --> 00:13:31,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait, Choji! Leave this to me!</font>

245
00:13:31,790 --> 00:13:34,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Naruto...
— Hey, Sakura...</font>

246
00:13:35,250 --> 00:13:38,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We are Shinobi, right?</font>

247
00:13:38,750 --> 00:13:43,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, then, let's show them
the Ninja way to make noodles!</font>

248
00:13:44,590 --> 00:13:46,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

249
00:13:57,190 --> 00:13:59,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rasengan! "Ichiraku" version!</font>

250
00:14:02,980 --> 00:14:06,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! Mixing ingredients
with Chakra?!</font>

251
00:14:09,660 --> 00:14:15,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, that way he'll surely be able
to mix the ingredients uniformly!</font>

252
00:14:15,830 --> 00:14:18,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And in micro units!</font>

253
00:14:23,250 --> 00:14:24,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura!</font>

254
00:14:25,010 --> 00:14:26,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

255
00:14:27,470 --> 00:14:28,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pervy Sage.</font>

256
00:14:29,220 --> 00:14:31,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

257
00:14:31,300 --> 00:14:33,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shannaro!</font>

258
00:14:39,850 --> 00:14:41,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this crazy strength...?!</font>

259
00:14:42,360 --> 00:14:45,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If she does that,
the noodles will become super firm!</font>

260
00:14:49,700 --> 00:14:51,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, Sakura!</font>

261
00:14:51,320 --> 00:14:52,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji!</font>

262
00:14:52,700 --> 00:14:55,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I, too, am a Shinobi of Leaf Village!</font>

263
00:14:55,990 --> 00:14:59,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Partial Expansion Jutsu: Both Hands!</font>

264
00:15:05,170 --> 00:15:06,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

265
00:15:09,090 --> 00:15:11,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What outstanding noodles!</font>

266
00:15:11,720 --> 00:15:16,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If those noodles are added
to Teuchi's soup, this match would...</font>

267
00:15:18,850 --> 00:15:21,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We cannot lose!</font>

268
00:15:22,190 --> 00:15:24,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's for the future of the Ninja Chef!</font>

269
00:15:25,150 --> 00:15:27,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now they just have to be boiled, Teuchi!</font>

270
00:15:28,360 --> 00:15:30,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! Leave it to me!</font>

271
00:15:30,150 --> 00:15:31,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait a minute!</font>

272
00:15:34,160 --> 00:15:36,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When the ramen is done,</font>

273
00:15:36,790 --> 00:15:38,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who will you serve it to first?</font>

274
00:15:38,870 --> 00:15:40,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Who...?</font>

275
00:15:41,330 --> 00:15:43,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right. That's how it is!</font>

276
00:15:44,130 --> 00:15:45,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's how what is?</font>

277
00:15:46,040 --> 00:15:47,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Among chefs,</font>

278
00:15:47,460 --> 00:15:49,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's a cardinal rule
not to be forgotten.</font>

279
00:15:50,470 --> 00:15:54,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The first guest to arrive is
the first guest served!</font>

280
00:15:54,890 --> 00:15:57,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter how delicious
the food you make is,</font>

281
00:15:57,680 --> 00:16:00,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if you break this cardinal rule,
you're disqualified as a chef!</font>

282
00:16:02,640 --> 00:16:05,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">True, if a guy who came later
were eating before me,</font>

283
00:16:05,860 --> 00:16:07,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">then it would seriously piss me off.</font>

284
00:16:07,820 --> 00:16:10,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are 100 Ninja Chefs here.</font>

285
00:16:10,610 --> 00:16:13,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They all showed up
at about the same time!</font>

286
00:16:13,200 --> 00:16:18,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, you have to serve ramen
to 100 people at the same time!</font>

287
00:16:18,120 --> 00:16:19,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're four people.</font>

288
00:16:19,790 --> 00:16:23,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can you really serve
at the same time?</font>

289
00:16:24,290 --> 00:16:26,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I said we're Ninja, didn't I?</font>

290
00:16:27,500 --> 00:16:29,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

291
00:16:32,260 --> 00:16:33,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

292
00:16:43,350 --> 00:16:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now! Lift them!</font>

293
00:16:52,860 --> 00:16:55,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks for waiting. Here you go!</font>

294
00:16:57,160 --> 00:17:02,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The taste is the issue!
If you don't satisfy us, you lose!</font>

295
00:17:13,800 --> 00:17:15,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Delicious!</font>

296
00:17:15,760 --> 00:17:18,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Delicious!</font>

297
00:17:19,180 --> 00:17:21,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've never had ramen this delicious.</font>

298
00:17:23,430 --> 00:17:26,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— So, then...
— We win!</font>

299
00:17:27,350 --> 00:17:29,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We did it!</font>

300
00:17:30,480 --> 00:17:31,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The truth is...</font>

301
00:17:31,650 --> 00:17:34,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we Ninja Chefs are
at the end of our rope.</font>

302
00:17:35,490 --> 00:17:36,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">End of your rope?</font>

303
00:17:36,820 --> 00:17:38,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean by that?</font>

304
00:17:38,910 --> 00:17:44,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We endeavored to make delicious meals
to eat during missions.</font>

305
00:17:45,160 --> 00:17:47,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We thought to make delicious food
to fill your stomach</font>

306
00:17:47,960 --> 00:17:49,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that can be eaten anywhere.</font>

307
00:17:52,000 --> 00:17:55,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But we pursued taste too far.</font>

308
00:17:55,840 --> 00:17:59,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was too delicious,
people were compelled to overeat.</font>

309
00:17:59,180 --> 00:18:00,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And as a result...</font>

310
00:18:05,480 --> 00:18:10,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja gained weight,
and it interfered with their missions.</font>

311
00:18:10,900 --> 00:18:12,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And some people are now saying:</font>

312
00:18:12,820 --> 00:18:15,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"We don't need
the Ninja Chefs anymore."</font>

313
00:18:17,400 --> 00:18:20,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For us Ninja Chefs to continue,</font>

314
00:18:20,450 --> 00:18:23,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we had to get our hands
on the phantom recipe out there</font>

315
00:18:23,450 --> 00:18:25,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in the cooking world!</font>

316
00:18:25,540 --> 00:18:26,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Recipe?</font>

317
00:18:27,210 --> 00:18:28,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we use this recipe,</font>

318
00:18:28,790 --> 00:18:32,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we can improve the performance
of Shinobi without causing a burden.</font>

319
00:18:32,590 --> 00:18:34,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's such a recipe?</font>

320
00:18:34,920 --> 00:18:37,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hear, it's called the scum recipe.</font>

321
00:18:37,590 --> 00:18:39,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The scum recipe?</font>

322
00:18:39,720 --> 00:18:42,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We've gathered information
from everywhere.</font>

323
00:18:42,680 --> 00:18:43,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As a result,</font>

324
00:18:43,760 --> 00:18:47,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we learned that the scum recipe was
at "Ichiraku," which Teuchi runs.</font>

325
00:18:48,020 --> 00:18:49,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

326
00:18:50,190 --> 00:18:51,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know!</font>

327
00:18:51,810 --> 00:18:53,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no reason something
like that should be at my shop!</font>

328
00:18:53,730 --> 00:18:55,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's someone who heard it!</font>

329
00:18:57,400 --> 00:18:59,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've got the scum recipe
at my shop, so...</font>

330
00:19:00,360 --> 00:19:02,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, Teuchi...?</font>

331
00:19:02,200 --> 00:19:03,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I might have that.</font>

332
00:19:04,280 --> 00:19:05,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you serious?!</font>

333
00:19:05,790 --> 00:19:07,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought so!</font>

334
00:19:07,450 --> 00:19:10,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To be precise,
it's the scum-removal recipe.</font>

335
00:19:13,000 --> 00:19:14,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Scum removal?</font>

336
00:19:14,880 --> 00:19:16,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The trick to making delicious soup...</font>

337
00:19:16,880 --> 00:19:19,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is how well you remove the scum.</font>

338
00:19:20,300 --> 00:19:21,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, I, too, studied a lot.</font>

339
00:19:21,930 --> 00:19:26,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eventually, I worked out a recipe
that can remove the scum effectively.</font>

340
00:19:27,350 --> 00:19:30,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Usually it's called
the scum recipe for short.</font>

341
00:19:31,060 --> 00:19:34,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I never thought
that this misunderstanding would arise.</font>

342
00:19:34,440 --> 00:19:36,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's a pretty big omission.</font>

343
00:19:37,570 --> 00:19:40,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gee, that's a stupid punch line.</font>

344
00:19:41,780 --> 00:19:43,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We won the cooking match,</font>

345
00:19:43,820 --> 00:19:45,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so keep your promise
and return Ayame!</font>

346
00:19:46,030 --> 00:19:48,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right! Where is she?!</font>

347
00:19:49,290 --> 00:19:50,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Father!</font>

348
00:19:51,830 --> 00:19:54,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ayame?</font>

349
00:20:00,050 --> 00:20:02,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ayame... is that you?</font>

350
00:20:02,380 --> 00:20:03,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can't you tell by looking?</font>

351
00:20:03,930 --> 00:20:07,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Ayame is like...</font>

352
00:20:10,560 --> 00:20:16,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The food they make is
so delicious, I overeat.</font>

353
00:20:16,820 --> 00:20:18,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did I gain that much weight?</font>

354
00:20:18,480 --> 00:20:19,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ayame!</font>

355
00:20:24,110 --> 00:20:25,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ichiraku's new menu?</font>

356
00:20:26,030 --> 00:20:28,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The thing we made
at the cooking challenge?</font>

357
00:20:28,870 --> 00:20:32,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, a diet ramen
that's popular among girls.</font>

358
00:20:32,500 --> 00:20:34,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Diet ramen?</font>

359
00:20:38,090 --> 00:20:40,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's super popular!</font>

360
00:20:43,050 --> 00:20:45,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, come on in, Naruto.</font>

361
00:20:45,550 --> 00:20:47,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've regained your former shape.</font>

362
00:20:48,140 --> 00:20:50,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's thanks
to my father's diet ramen!</font>

363
00:20:51,140 --> 00:20:53,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Where's your father?</font>

364
00:20:53,060 --> 00:20:57,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, while he was joining me
in eating the diet ramen...</font>

