<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Neucha"><font size="30"><b>decisive, encounter, life, mutual love</b></font></font></font>

405
00:22:38,340 --> 00:22:40,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Does anyone have anything
to ask about this mission?</font>

406
00:22:40,590 --> 00:22:41,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I've got a question!</font>

407
00:22:41,390 --> 00:22:43,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Why should I have to go on
a mission with this group?</font>

408
00:22:43,260 --> 00:22:45,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Okay, let's move on.
Everyone ready?</font>

409
00:22:45,470 --> 00:22:47,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Hey, I've got a question!</font>

410
00:22:47,640 --> 00:22:48,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">As for the mission details,</font>

411
00:22:48,730 --> 00:22:50,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">we're to eliminate the Demon of the Ocean
in the Land of Oceans.</font>

412
00:22:50,480 --> 00:22:51,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">You guys are going to get
fired up for me</font>

413
00:22:51,940 --> 00:22:53,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">since you came to serve under me!</font>

414
00:22:53,400 --> 00:22:54,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Just a minute.
Hey, listen to me!</font>

415
00:22:54,940 --> 00:22:56,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Now, let's get going!</font>

416
00:22:56,400 --> 00:22:58,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Stop complaining and
just come with me!</font>

417
00:22:58,820 --> 00:23:00,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Listen to me, I say.
Listen! Listen! Listen!</font>

418
00:23:01,030 --> 00:23:03,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"Memory, the Lost Page."</font>

